# mghouse.msg - door of the Empty House, later the player's house (mghouse.ssl). One entry per line.

# 100 locked, 101 unlocked with the key or by right, 102 already unlocked.
{100}{}{The door is padlocked, and the padlock has rusted into one piece. Nobody has lived here for a long time.}
{101}{}{The padlock gives up with a crack of rust. The house is yours.}
{102}{}{The door is already unlocked.}
# 103, 104 looks; 107, 108 descriptions (before and after the house is the player's).
{103}{}{You see the door of an empty house.}
{104}{}{You see the door of your house.}
{107}{}{Planks, tin and a padlock. Somebody chalked a name on the door once. The rain has had most of it.}
{108}{}{Planks, tin and no padlock. It is not much of a door, but it is the only one in the wasteland with your name on it.}
# 105, 106 the Lockpick skill.
{105}{}{The padlock is old and you are patient. It opens.}
{106}{}{The padlock is rusted solid. Picking it is like picking a rock.}
